<ul class="list-aggregate marqueeinner" id="marquee-news">
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="/student/student-council">Media Coverage of SBES</a> </li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="#.">
<p><span>BGA  Membership</span></p>
<p align="justify">Congratulations, IIMS Pune is now the member of prestigious International <b>Business Graduate Association</b> BGA - AMBA . Now it is an opportunity for all the Students and Faculty to interact with Global B School Students' and Faculty.<br/>
</li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="#.">
<p><span>Congratulations !!!</span></p>
<p align="justify">IIMS Pune congratulates Prof. Manish R. Mundada, Founder President, SaiBalaji Group of Institutes and Dr. Mayanka Sharma, Professor, SBIIMS for Patent in marketing field for developing  <br/>"<b>System and Method for Delivering Marketing Messages</b>". <br/>Proud Moment !!!
                 </p>
</a> </li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="#.">
<p><span>Admissions Open for Batch: 2023 - 2025</span></p>
<p>** Dear Candidates, <br/> <br/> Admissions to PGDM / PGDM (Retail) are open for Academic Year 2023 - 25.  <br/> Interested Candidates may Apply Online. <br/>For details email at admissions@iimspune.edu.in or call at 020-66547500
                 </p>
</a> </li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="#.">
<p><span>MoU between IIMS Pune &<br/> Babson Academy, USA</span></p>
<p> Dear All, it is a pleasure to announce that IIMS Pune and Babson Academy (Babson College University, USA) has signed an MoU for imparting world class Entrepreneurship Education. <br/> <br/>
<a href="/images/pdf/IIMS-Babson-Agreement.pdf" target="_blank">Click Here to know more</a>
</li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="#.">
<p><span>MoU between IIMS Pune &<br/> Malaysia University of Science & Technology</span></p>
<p> Dear All, it is a pleasure to announce that IIMS Pune and Malaysia University of Science & Technology has signed an MoU on May 18<sup>th</sup> 2019 at IIMS Pune<br/>Benefits of the MoU are as follows.<br/><br/>
<li>Faculty Exchange Program</li>
<li>Student Exchange Program</li>
<li> Joint collaborative Research</li>
<li> Students Development Program to improve employability & enhancing International Placements</li>
</li>
<li class="fat-l"> <a href="/about-us/rankings-and-ratings">
<p><span>Rankings & Awards:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong> Best Placements Award 2022 - Navbharat Education Awards </strong></li>
<li><strong>Best Business School in Placements </strong>- Western Region - April - 2022, Trade & Media and My Brand Better
                <li><strong> Ranked 13<sup>th</sup>, All India, Private B Schools, 2023 - Times of India</strong></li>
<li><strong> Best Academic and Industry Interface Award - ABP News 2018</strong></li>
<li><strong>SaiBalaji Group of Institutes ( IIMS | SBIIMS | IIMHRD (w)  ) is  recognized as 10 Best Institutes in Maharashtra of the Year 2018, 2019 - The Knowledge Review</strong></li>
<li><strong>'Great Indian Institutes' 2018 - Forbes India Marquee.</strong></li>
<li><strong>Best Education Brands of 2019 - The Economic Times March 2019 </strong></li>
<li><strong>"National Education Awards 2017" - ABP News, for Best Placements.</strong></li>
<li><strong> "Education Leadership Award" by BBC Knowledge at World HRD Congress.</strong></li>
<li><strong>"Top Private Management Institute, Western India" by Jagranjosh.com, Dainik Jagran Group </strong></li>
