<p>The PGDM Program at IIMS is designed to meet the expectations of the today's industry's demand. We have included different certification programs like SAP <br/>Business Analytics <br/>Digital Marketing <br/> Foreign Language <br/> Six Sigma <br/> Finishing School Program<br/> The PGDM Program at IIMS Pune gives 45 days Winter Internship and 90 days Summer Internship as well as 2 Live Projects of 100 hours each. </p>
